    public static T Or<T\>(ref T location, T value) where T : struct;
}

These methods support all integer primitive types (`byte`, `sbyte`, `short`, `ushort`, `int`, `uint`, `long`, `ulong`, `nint`, `nuint`) and any enum backed by these types.

